4.Given the following widget tree: Scaffold > Column > [ProfilePic, Username, FollowersRow],
draw or describe the widget hierarchy for a BookMyShow-like movie ticket card, including at least four widgets.


Scaffold
 └── Card
      └── Column
           ├── Image
           ├── Text (Movie Name)
           ├── Text (Time & Date)
           └── ElevatedButton (Book Now)

Description:--

  1.  Scaffold – Provides the main screen structure of the Flutter app.
  2.  Card – Creates a movie ticket card with a raised/elevated appearance.
  3.  Column – Arranges all movie information vertically.
  4.  Image – Displays the movie poster.
  5.  Text – Displays the movie name, such as "Avengers: Endgame".
  6.  Text – Displays movie details such as "7:00 PM | Screen 2".
  7.  ElevatedButton – Provides a "Book Now" button for booking tickets.
